  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1498481/description_54ed8f2b-1b7e-4fde-a0cc-55a75ee1e294.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>功能特色：</h2>\n<h3>世界生成</h3>\n<p><strong>👉</strong> 全面重构了来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tectonic</a> 的主世界地形与生物群系生成</p>\n<p>👉 来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/incendium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Incendium</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mns-moogs-nether-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Nether Structures</a> 等的全新下界生物群系与结构</p>\n<p>👉 来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderscape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderscape</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-end-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's End Structures</a> 等的全新末地生物群系与结构</p>\n<p>👉 回溯移植了 <em><strong>Bundles of Bravery</strong></em>、<em><strong>The Garden Awakens</strong></em>、<em><strong>Spring to Life</strong></em>、<em><strong>Chase the Skies</strong></em> 和 <em><strong>Chaos Cubed</strong></em> 中引入的现代 Minecraft 特性</p>\n<p>👉 对原版地牢和结构进行了重大重新设计</p>\n<p>👉 来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252froguelikedungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roguelike Dungeons</a> 等的具有不同难度的全新地牢与结构</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>探索与生存</h3>\n<p>👉 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite</a> - 4种具有独特属性的全新下界合金等级</p>\n<p>👉 来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-farm-charm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farm &amp; Charm</a> 及若干精选扩展包的全新食物/农作物</p>\n<p>👉 墓碑，可在主世界和下界死亡时保护你的物品不消失</p>\n<p>👉 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidtotem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Void Totem</a>（虚空图腾），防止你掉入虚空</p>\n<p>👉 可制作且可升级的背包，来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></p>\n<p>👉 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's World Map</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a>，辅助探索与导航</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>建造</h3>\n<p>👉 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/effortless\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Effortless Structure</a> - 轻松创建结构与进行设计</p>\n<p>👉 来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Handcrafted</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/macaws-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Furniture</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a> 等的新家具/装饰方块</p>\n<p>👉 玩家自建商店，来自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspuds-shops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spud's Shops</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>杂项</h3>\n<p>👉 <strong>无需安装 Optifine！</strong> 内置着色器支持、连接纹理及其他 Optifine 功能</p>\n<p>👉 大量提升生活质量以及性能/优化的模组</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#f00\"><strong>不兼容 Optifine！</strong></p>\n<h2>鸣谢：</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>资源包：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-waystones-texture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Waystones Texture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fenderscape-more-emissives\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderscape More Emissives</a> (Modrinth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hellims-xaeros-maps-mob-icons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hellim's Xaero's Maps Mob Icons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recolourful Containers GUI + HUD</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsparkles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sparkles: Stardust Labs Resourcepack</a> (Modrinth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stay-true\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stay True</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/travelers-backpack-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack Overhaul</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fxaeros-map-frame\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Map Frame</a> (Modrinth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fxaeros-vanilla-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Vanilla GUI</a> (Modrinth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/xalis-enchanted-books\" rel=\"nofollow\">xali's Enchanted Books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/xalis-enchanted-books-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">xali's Enchanted Books - Addon</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>着色器包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders - Reimagined</a></p>\n</div>",
